1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,437
Startup ASEAN creates thousands of connections.

2
00:00:03,437 --> 00:00:05,475
But how many become real deals?

3
00:00:05,475 --> 00:00:07,262
Today, nobody can say.

4
00:00:07,980 --> 00:00:12,480
Nexus Net turns those connections
into measurable outcomes — as a game.

5
00:00:13,467 --> 00:00:16,867
Startups register and upload their company documents.

6
00:00:16,867 --> 00:00:23,192
Gemma 4 checks the name, registration number and
country, and issues a verified company passport.

7
00:00:23,907 --> 00:00:28,132
Every startup levels up — from
Connected, all the way to Funded.

8
00:00:30,958 --> 00:00:36,570
Six quick taps, and Gemma turns their gaps
into quests — matched with the right talent.

9
00:00:39,343 --> 00:00:42,855
Gemma 4 writes personalised, cross-border quests.

10
00:00:45,446 --> 00:00:46,633
Upload the proof.

11
00:00:46,633 --> 00:00:50,708
Gemma verifies it, XP jumps, and the startup levels up.

12
00:00:50,708 --> 00:00:52,021
That's a real outcome.

13
00:00:53,164 --> 00:00:58,414
Founders discover the right ecosystem
events — and earn bonus XP for showing up.

14
00:00:59,116 --> 00:01:02,278
Startups compete for the top of the season leaderboard.

15
00:01:04,475 --> 00:01:08,662
The live ASEAN map draws every
verified cross-border outcome.

16
00:01:08,662 --> 00:01:12,075
Filter by type, or follow one startup across the region.

17
00:01:13,526 --> 00:01:20,363
And Cradle finally sees the funnel — from connection
to investment — live, by country and by event.

18
00:01:21,193 --> 00:01:22,243
Nexus Net.

19
00:01:22,243 --> 00:01:24,580
Every quest is a measurable outcome.

20
00:01:24,580 --> 00:01:25,980
Built with Gemma 4.
